@startuml
participant PO
participant "FastAPI" as F
database "CloudSQL" as C
participant "ArtifactMCP" as A
PO -> F: list sessions
F -> C: query sessions
C --> F: sessions
F --> PO: session list (story, date, status)
PO -> F: restore session ID
F -> C: load session history (incl. artifact references)
C --> F: history
F -> A: fetch artifacts by reference
A --> F: artifacts
F --> PO: history replay + artifacts
note over PO,F
completed sessions are read-only;
option: new session on same story
end note
@enduml
